{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04906","headline":"奉和春日幸望春宫应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东城结宇敞千寻，北阙回舆具四临。\n丽日祥烟承罕毕，轻荑弱草藉衣簪。\n秦商重沓云岩近，河渭萦纡雾壑深。\n谬接鵷鸿陪赏乐，还欣鱼鸟遂飞沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}